                "circuitos"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Para ver CLOSED -> OPEN -> HALF_OPEN -> CLOSED: `docker compose stop mediciones`, enviar 3 veces *Resumen general* (503), consultar *Estado de los circuitos* (OPEN), `docker compose start mediciones`, esperar 10 s (HALF_OPEN) y enviar *Resumen general* (200, vuelve a CLOSED)."
    },
